---
description: When editing docs, keep CHANGELOG in sync for visible changes
globs: docs/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

# Docs rules

- If a change is **user-visible**, **API**, **permission**, or **OAuth** related, add an entry under **Unreleased** in `docs/CHANGELOG.md` in the same PR.
- Prefer updating `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` when boundaries move (new service, new data store, new permission).
